{
  "slug": "evanflow",
  "name": "Evanflow",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A TDD-driven iterative feedback loop for software development. 16 cohesive Claude Code skills walk an idea from brainstorm → plan → execute → tdd → iterate, with checkpoints throughout.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **16 skills**, **2 agents** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (16): `evanflow` (Meta skill for the EvanFlow system), `evanflow-brainstorming` (Clarify intent, propose 2-3 approaches, embedded grill to stress-test the chosen path), `evanflow-coder-overseer` (Orchestrate parallel implementation with coder/overseer pairs), `evanflow-compact` (Manage long-session context to prevent drift and degradation), `evanflow-debug` (Root-cause discipline for bugs, test failures, and unexpected behavior), `evanflow-design-interface` (Design a module's interface using parallel sub-agents producing radically different designs (\"design it twice\")), `evanflow-executing-plans` (Execute a written implementation plan task-by-task with inline verification), `evanflow-glossary` (Extract canonical domain terms into CONTEXT.md), and 8 more\n- **Agents** (2): `evanflow-coder` (Implementation subagent for one decomposed unit of work in the evanflow-coder-overseer pattern), `evanflow-overseer` (Read-only review subagent for one coder's output (or for cross-coder integration review) in the evanflow-coder-overseer pattern)\n- **Hooks** (1): `PreToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install evanflow@claude-community` from `evanklem/evanflow`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 16,
    "agent": 2,
    "hook": 1
  },
